[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0010","text":"天气放晴了，是绝佳的赶海日，但是……\n阳光这么强的话就有点……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0020","text":"是啊\n等结束的时候感觉都要被热化了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0030","text":"脖子上……围条毛巾……怎么样……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0040","text":"毛巾也行啦—\n不过我更想要更舒适的东西—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0050","text":"舒适～？\n什么样的～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0060","text":"有屋顶能挡住阳光—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0070","text":"嗯嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0080","text":"还有舒适的空调—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0090","text":"再给我准备个能躺着打滚的\n沙发的话—"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30500200_04_0100","text":"摩美美……\n那已经不算赶海了吧……？"}]
